sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Frontend as workspaces-frontend<br/>:8080/TCP nginx
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Backend as workspaces-backend<br/>:4000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAuth as Kubernetes Auth API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as workspaces-controller<br/>:8081/TCP
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>:9443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,Webhook: Flow 1: User Creates Workspace via API

    User->>Frontend: Browse workspace UI
    Frontend->>Gateway: REST API call
    Gateway->>Backend: /api/v1/workspaces/{ns}<br/>Bearer Token
    Backend->>K8sAuth: TokenReview<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    K8sAuth-->>Backend: User identity
    Backend->>K8sAuth: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(create workspaces)
    K8sAuth-->>Backend: Allowed
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Create Workspace CR<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Workspace created
    Backend-->>Gateway: 201 Created
    Gateway-->>Frontend: Response
    Frontend-->>User: Workspace created

    Note over User,Webhook: Flow 2: Controller Reconciles Workspace

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: Workspace created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service + SA + RoleBinding<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute<br/>(in gateway namespace)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ReferenceGrant<br/>(cross-namespace)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create kube-rbac-proxy<br/>ConfigMap + ClusterRoleBinding<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workspace status<br/>TLS 1.2+

    Note over User,Webhook: Flow 3: Webhook Validation

    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission request<br/>:9443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (cluster profile)
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: Read WorkspaceKind<br/>for validation context
    K8sAPI-->>Webhook: WorkspaceKind data
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admit / Deny
